# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` / `gcloud builds submit` uploads to
# Cloud Build. Without this file gcloud infers exclusions from .gitignore;
# being explicit keeps secrets and local state off the wire.
#
# Cloud Build needs Dockerfile and .dockerignore, so they are NOT listed here —
# .dockerignore then decides what actually enters the image.

.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets — never upload any env file except the placeholder example.
.env*
!.env.example

# Regenerated during the build
node_modules
dist
generated
coverage
*.log

# Local runtime state
uploads
